' --- manual: everything below this line is hand-authored; the script preserves it ---

' The automated pass reads data members, so a class whose content is methods
' arrives as an empty box and a facet of free functions does not arrive at all.
' This pass fills those boxes with the API and draws the seams the automated pass
' cannot see: the composition point, the registry, and the state maps.
'
' Fully-qualified class names rather than a reopened namespace block: declaring a
' namespace a second time creates a second package rather than merging into the
' first. Redeclaring a class merges its members into the box the automated pass
' already drew, so a refresh keeps both passes.
'
' Stereotypes split the two kinds. <<generated>> is written by the generator from
' the model; <<hand-written>> is logic the model cannot express, which here is the
' engine, the handlers and the aggregate registrar.

